flowchart TD
    A[Start] --> B[Prepare debit, credit, and transaction SQL]
    B --> C[Open DB connection]
    C --> D[Disable auto-commit]
    D --> E[Debit source account]
    E --> F[Credit destination account]
    F --> G[Insert transaction row]
    G --> H[Commit transaction]
    H --> I[Return true]
    E --> J[On SQL error rollback]
    F --> J
    G --> J
    J --> K[Print stack trace]
    K --> L[Return false]
    C --> M[Outer SQL error]
    M --> K
    I --> N[End]
    L --> N
